KGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">토</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">해운대구 벡스코에서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">‘2016 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">드론챌린지 코리아</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">’</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">경진대회를 개최합니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 6pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\"></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">드론에 대한 대학생들의 관심을 제고하고 미래 드론산업의 발전 비전에 대한 공감대를 더욱 친근하게 형성하고자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">해상환경에서 드론을 활용한 자유 임무수행 경진대회 및 태국모형항공기협회의 드론 비행 시연</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">시뮬레이터 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">3D</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">체험 등 다양한 부대행사를 함께 진행하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">평소 드론에 관심이 있는 대학생들이 직접 드론을 조종해보고 체험할 수 있도록 하니&nbsp;참고하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">○ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">행사개요</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FON